config BR2_PACKAGE_BRICK_EMMC_RECOVERY
	bool "Brick read-only eMMC recovery profile"
	help
	  Dedicated image enabling the measured A133 eMMC DDR52 mode.
	  It identifies the fitted device and forces its user and boot
	  block devices read-only before other board services start.
	  USB gadget recovery remains available. This is disabled by
	  default.
